    "description": "Manage Your Xcel Energy Account\r\n\r\n<b>Secure</b>\r\n\r\nOpt-in to use Face ID as a quicker way to sign in and as an added layer of protection to keep your data and account information secure.  \r\n\r\n<b>Pay</b>\r\n\r\nEasily log in to view your billing information and statements, check your balance and make payments.  \r\n\r\n<b>Report</b>\r\n\r\n Report an outage or check on your outage status.  \r\n\r\n<b>View</b>\r\n\r\nSee a complete view of your current and historical usage data.  \r\n\r\n<b>Track</b>\r\n\r\nCompare your bills and track your electric and/or gas usage for the past 12 months with usage graphs and tables.",
